    teaching: [
      { en: "White papers persuade senior partners through calm structural clarity—state principles first, then the concrete operational mechanisms enforcing them.", ar: "تُقنع الأوراق البيضاء الشركاء بالوضوح الهيكلي: المبدأ أولًا ثم الآلية التشغيلية التي تطبّقه فعليًا." },
      { en: "Avoid empty marketing buzzwords ('world-class revolutionary synergy')—every noun should map to an inspectable practice.", ar: "تجنّب الشعارات التسويقية الفارغة واجعل كل عبارة تقابل ممارسة قابلة للفحص." },
    ],
    example: "Trust in online education is earned through inspectable architecture rather than bold slogans. Accordingly, academy governance rests on three operational pillars: pedagogical integrity, data minimisation, and transparent financial stewardship. Pedagogically, all assessments separate objective automated scoring from calibrated instructor oversight so credentials reflect verifiable skill. Technically, learner records adhere strictly to Saudi personal-data standards, collecting solely attributes required for enrolment and certificate verification. Financially, relying on open-source core infrastructure keeps operating overhead lean, ensuring tuition remains equitable while reinvesting revenue into qualified instructors rather than vendor lock-in.",
